Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: apollo: define the bootloader reboot mode

Apollo currently registers qcom-pon without any reboot mode definitions,
so reboot("bootloader") writes no reason and returns to normal Linux.
Use the bootloader reason already used by SM8250 MTP and the downstream
PON_RESTART_REASON_BOOTLOADER value. No power, voltage or partition change.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-apollo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-apollo.dts
@@ -1723,6 +1723,10 @@
 	};
 };
 
+&pon {
+	mode-bootloader = <0x2>;
+};
+
 &pon_pwrkey {
 	status = "okay";
 };
